{"seq":3,"slug":"capacity-planning-process","title":"容量规划流程：年度规划、大促预案与红线告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/operations/capacity-planning-process","wordCount":1355,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"容量规划流程-年度规划-大促预案与红线告警\">容量规划流程：年度规划、大促预案与红线告警</h1><p>容量规划不是一次性的工作，而是需要持续运营的工程纪律。<strong>系统化的容量规划流程</strong>将散落的技术实践组织成可重复执行的工作流，确保系统在增长、大促和意外突发面前始终有足够的容量缓冲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>战略层容量规划</td>\n<td>年度维度：资源预算、架构演进优先级、长期增长预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>战术层容量规划</td>\n<td>季度/月度维度：实际 vs 预测对比，识别瓶颈并优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大促预案</td>\n<td>针对特定高峰事件的完整准备-执行-恢复流程，从 T-30 天开始</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红线告警</td>\n<td>按容量利用率分级（黄/橙/红）的分级告警体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RI（Reserved Instances）</td>\n<td>预留实例，承诺 1~3 年使用量换取最高 72% 的折扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAPE</td>\n<td>容量规划准确率衡量指标；目标 MAPE &lt; 15%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"容量规划的三个时间维度\">容量规划的三个时间维度</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph strategic [&quot;战略层(年度)&quot;]&#10;        A[&quot;年度容量规划\\n资源预算、架构演进\\n长期增长预测&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph tactical [&quot;战术层(季度/月度)&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;滚动容量评审\\n实际 vs 预测对比\\n瓶颈识别和优化&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph ops [&quot;运营层(事件级)&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;大促预案\\n压测验证\\n临时扩容&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;红线告警\\n容量告警\\n自动处置&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; B --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph strategic [\"战略层(年度)\"]\n        A[\"年度容量规划\\n资源预算、架构演进\\n长期增长预测\"]\n    end\n    subgraph tactical [\"战术层(季度/月度)\"]\n        B[\"滚动容量评审\\n实际 vs 预测对比\\n瓶颈识别和优化\"]\n    end\n    subgraph ops [\"运营层(事件级)\"]\n        C[\"大促预案\\n压测验证\\n临时扩容\"]\n        D[\"红线告警\\n容量告警\\n自动处置\"]\n    end\n    A --&gt; B --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"年度容量规划\">年度容量规划</h2><p>年度容量规划的核心目标：确定下一年度的<strong>资源预算</strong>和<strong>架构演进优先级</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"年度规划流程\">年度规划流程</h3><p><strong>第一步：回顾历史使用趋势（Q4 第一周）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 分析过去一年各服务的增长曲线&#10;import pandas as pd&#10;from scipy import stats&#10;&#10;def calculate_growth_rate(monthly_qps: list) -&gt; float:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;计算月度复合增长率（CAGR）&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    x = list(range(len(monthly_qps)))&#10;    y = [q for q in monthly_qps]&#10;&#10;    # 使用对数回归拟合增长率&#10;    log_y = [math.log(v) for v in y]&#10;    slope, intercept, r_value, _, _ = stats.linregress(x, log_y)&#10;    monthly_growth_rate = math.exp(slope) - 1&#10;&#10;    return monthly_growth_rate&#10;&#10;# 示例：最近 12 个月的 QPS 数据&#10;services = {&#10;    &#39;order-api&#39;: [1000, 1050, 1120, 1180, 1250, 1280, 1340, 1390, 1450, 1510, 1580, 1650],&#10;    &#39;user-api&#39;:  [800,   810,  820,  830,  840,  850,  860,  870,  880,  890,  900,  910],&#10;    &#39;search-api&#39;: [2000, 2300, 2600, 2900, 3300, 3700, 4100, 4600, 5100, 5700, 6300, 7000],&#10;}&#10;&#10;for service, monthly_qps in services.items():&#10;    growth_rate = calculate_growth_rate(monthly_qps)&#10;    print(f&quot;{service}: 月增长率 {growth_rate:.1%}, 年增长率 {((1+growth_rate)**12 - 1):.0%}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分析过去一年各服务的增长曲线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculate_growth_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(monthly_qps: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"计算月度复合增长率（CAGR）\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(monthly_qps)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monthly_qps]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 使用对数回归拟合增长率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    log_y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [math.log(v) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slope, intercept, r_value, _, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats.linregress(x, log_y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    monthly_growth_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.exp(slope) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monthly_growth_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 示例：最近 12 个月的 QPS 数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">services </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'order-api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1050</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1180</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1250</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1280</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1340</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1390</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1450</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1510</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1580</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1650</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'user-api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">810</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">820</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">830</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">840</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">850</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">860</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">870</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">880</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">890</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">910</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'search-api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> service, monthly_qps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> services.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    growth_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> calculate_growth_rate(monthly_qps)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">service</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: 月增长率 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">growth_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, 年增长率 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">growth_rate)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.0%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第二步：预测下一年度容量需求</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>服务</th>\n<th>当前 QPS (P99)</th>\n<th>增长率（年）</th>\n<th>12 个月后 QPS</th>\n<th>当前实例数</th>\n<th>预计需要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>order-api</td>\n<td>1650</td>\n<td>65%</td>\n<td>2723</td>\n<td>10 Pod</td>\n<td>17 Pod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>user-api</td>\n<td>910</td>\n<td>14%</td>\n<td>1038</td>\n<td>5 Pod</td>\n<td>6 Pod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>search-api</td>\n<td>7000</td>\n<td>350%</td>\n<td>31500</td>\n<td>15 Pod</td>\n<td>需要架构优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第三步：识别瓶颈和架构演进需求</strong></p>\n<p>当预测增长超过当前架构的扩展上限时（参考 USL 分析），需要立项架构优化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>瓶颈类型</th>\n<th>识别方法</th>\n<th>优先级判断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据库写入瓶颈</td>\n<td>主库 CPU P99 &gt; 70% + 写 QPS 增长 &gt; 30%/年</td>\n<td>12 个月内触达上限 → 高优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点缓存瓶颈</td>\n<td>Redis 连接数接近上限</td>\n<td>6 个月内触达 → 紧急</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络带宽瓶颈</td>\n<td>出口带宽 P99 &gt; 80%</td>\n<td>计算触达时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 扩展上限（USL 饱和）</td>\n<td>副本数增加收益递减</td>\n<td>开始架构重构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第四步：输出资源预算申请</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"年度容量规划报告&#10;=================&#10;【现状】&#10;- 服务总数：47 个&#10;- 当前月度云成本：$320,000&#10;- 平均 CPU 利用率：28%（过度分配）&#10;&#10;【预测】&#10;- 预测 12 个月后流量增长：45%&#10;- 需要新增资源成本：$50,000/月&#10;- Rightsizing 可节省：$80,000/月（通过 VPA 推荐）&#10;&#10;【架构演进需求】&#10;1. search-api 数据库读写分离（Q1，优先级：高）&#10;2. order-api 引入消息队列削峰（Q2，优先级：中）&#10;&#10;【净预算申请】&#10;- 增量资源：+$50,000/月&#10;- Rightsizing 节省：-$80,000/月&#10;- 净影响：-$30,000/月（优化后反而节省）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>年度容量规划报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>=================</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>【现状】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 服务总数：47 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 当前月度云成本：$320,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 平均 CPU 利用率：28%（过度分配）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>【预测】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 预测 12 个月后流量增长：45%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 需要新增资源成本：$50,000/月</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Rightsizing 可节省：$80,000/月（通过 VPA 推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>【架构演进需求】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. search-api 数据库读写分离（Q1，优先级：高）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. order-api 引入消息队列削峰（Q2，优先级：中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>【净预算申请】</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 增量资源：+$50,000/月</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Rightsizing 节省：-$80,000/月</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 净影响：-$30,000/月（优化后反而节省）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"大促容量预案\">大促容量预案</h2><p><strong>大促预案</strong>是对特定高峰事件（双十一、618、春节等）的系统性容量准备。它不只是&quot;扩容多少实例&quot;，而是一套完整的准备-执行-恢复流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"大促预案模板\">大促预案模板</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"T-30 天：规模预测与容量测算&#10;─────────────────────────────────&#10;- 参考历史大促峰值倍率&#10;- 结合今年活动规模预期（GMV 目标、参与品牌数）&#10;- 输出各服务容量目标（峰值 QPS + 安全 headroom）&#10;&#10;T-21 天：架构梳理与限流配置&#10;─────────────────────────────────&#10;- 确认降级和限流开关已就位&#10;- 梳理单点和潜在瓶颈&#10;- 完成 RI/Spot 采购（提前预订低价资源）&#10;&#10;T-14 天：全链路压测&#10;─────────────────────────────────&#10;- 模拟大促峰值的 120% 进行压测&#10;- 记录各服务在该压力下的表现&#10;- 修复发现的 bug 和瓶颈&#10;&#10;T-7 天：预演（Dress Rehearsal）&#10;─────────────────────────────────&#10;- 完整模拟大促预扩容流程&#10;- 验证监控告警和降级开关&#10;- 确认 oncall 值班表&#10;&#10;T-1 天：预扩容&#10;─────────────────────────────────&#10;- 开始分批扩容，防止突发启动压力&#10;- 核心服务提前达到大促容量目标的 80%&#10;- 全量检查健康状态&#10;&#10;T+0（大促当天）：实时监控与调度&#10;─────────────────────────────────&#10;- 专项 oncall 值班（双人值班）&#10;- 5 分钟级监控大盘刷新&#10;- 分阶段激活预留的 Spot 资源&#10;&#10;T+3 天：缩容与复盘&#10;─────────────────────────────────&#10;- 分批次缩容（避免一次性缩容导致流量抖动）&#10;- 大促复盘报告（预测 vs 实际、发现的问题）&#10;- 更新下次大促的预案模板\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>T-30 天：规模预测与容量测算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>─────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 参考历史大促峰值倍率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 结合今年活动规模预期（GMV 目标、参与品牌数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 输出各服务容量目标（峰值 QPS + 安全 headroom）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T-21 天：架构梳理与限流配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>─────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 确认降级和限流开关已就位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 梳理单点和潜在瓶颈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 完成 RI/Spot 采购（提前预订低价资源）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T-14 天：全链路压测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>─────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 模拟大促峰值的 120% 进行压测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 记录各服务在该压力下的表现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 修复发现的 bug 和瓶颈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T-7 天：预演（Dress Rehearsal）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>─────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 完整模拟大促预扩容流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 验证监控告警和降级开关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 确认 oncall 值班表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T-1 天：预扩容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>─────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 开始分批扩容，防止突发启动压力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 核心服务提前达到大促容量目标的 80%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 全量检查健康状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T+0（大促当天）：实时监控与调度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>─────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 专项 oncall 值班（双人值班）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 5 分钟级监控大盘刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 分阶段激活预留的 Spot 资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>T+3 天：缩容与复盘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>─────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 分批次缩容（避免一次性缩容导致流量抖动）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 大促复盘报告（预测 vs 实际、发现的问题）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 更新下次大促的预案模板</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"大促伸缩时间轴\">大促伸缩时间轴</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间点</th>\n<th>核心服务</th>\n<th>非核心服务</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>T-2h</td>\n<td>50% 大促容量</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>开始预扩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T-30min</td>\n<td>80% 大促容量</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>加速扩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T-0</td>\n<td>100% 大促容量</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>就绪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T+1h</td>\n<td>自动伸缩接管</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>监控 + 按需调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T+24h</td>\n<td>逐步缩容</td>\n<td>快速缩容</td>\n<td>大促结束处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"红线告警体系\">红线告警体系</h2><p>**红线（Red Line）**是容量规划中最关键的运营工具：当系统接近容量极限时提前告警，留出时间处置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"红线分级体系\">红线分级体系</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph alerts [&quot;告警分级&quot;]&#10;        G[&quot;黄色告警(Yellow)\\n60%~75% 容量\\n关注,准备响应\\n通知值班工程师&quot;]&#10;        O[&quot;橙色告警(Orange)\\n75%~85% 容量\\n需要响应\\n触发 pagerduty&quot;]&#10;        R[&quot;红色告警(Red)\\n&gt;85% 容量\\n立即处置\\n触发事故流程&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    G --&gt; O --&gt; R\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph alerts [\"告警分级\"]\n        G[\"黄色告警(Yellow)\\n60%~75% 容量\\n关注,准备响应\\n通知值班工程师\"]\n        O[\"橙色告警(Orange)\\n75%~85% 容量\\n需要响应\\n触发 pagerduty\"]\n        R[\"红色告警(Red)\\n&gt;85% 容量\\n立即处置\\n触发事故流程\"]\n    end\n    G --&gt; O --&gt; R</pre><h3 id=\"典型红线指标配置\">典型红线指标配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Prometheus 告警规则示例&#10;groups:&#10;  - name: capacity-redlines&#10;    rules:&#10;      # CPU 利用率红线&#10;      - alert: CPUCapacityYellow&#10;        expr: |&#10;          avg(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{&#10;            namespace=&quot;production&quot;&#10;          }[5m])) by (deployment)&#10;          /&#10;          avg(kube_deployment_spec_template_cpu_requests{&#10;            namespace=&quot;production&quot;&#10;          }) by (deployment) &gt; 0.60&#10;        for: 10m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: warning&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;{{ $labels.deployment }} CPU 使用率超过 60%&#39;&#10;          runbook: &#39;https://wiki.example.com/runbooks/cpu-capacity&#39;&#10;&#10;      # HPA maxReplicas 接近上限&#10;      - alert: HPAMaxReplicasNearLimit&#10;        expr: |&#10;          kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_status_current_replicas&#10;          /&#10;          kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_spec_max_replicas &gt; 0.80&#10;        for: 5m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;{{ $labels.horizontalpodautoscaler }} 副本数达到 maxReplicas 的 80%&#39;&#10;          description: &#39;需要立即评估是否增加 maxReplicas 或进行架构优化&#39;&#10;&#10;      # 预置并发使用率（Lambda）&#10;      - alert: LambdaProvisionedConcurrencyHigh&#10;        expr: |&#10;          aws_lambda_provisioned_concurrency_utilization &gt; 0.85&#10;        for: 2m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;Lambda 预置并发使用率 &gt; 85%，冷启动风险上升&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Prometheus 告警规则示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">capacity-redlines</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # CPU 利用率红线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CPUCapacityYellow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          avg(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            namespace=\"production\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          }[5m])) by (deployment)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          avg(kube_deployment_spec_template_cpu_requests{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            namespace=\"production\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          }) by (deployment) > 0.60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ $labels.deployment }} CPU 使用率超过 60%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          runbook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://wiki.example.com/runbooks/cpu-capacity'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # HPA maxReplicas 接近上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HPAMaxReplicasNearLimit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_status_current_replicas</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_spec_max_replicas > 0.80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ $labels.horizontalpodautoscaler }} 副本数达到 maxReplicas 的 80%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'需要立即评估是否增加 maxReplicas 或进行架构优化'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 预置并发使用率（Lambda）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LambdaProvisionedConcurrencyHigh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          aws_lambda_provisioned_concurrency_utilization > 0.85</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Lambda 预置并发使用率 > 85%，冷启动风险上升'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"容量仪表盘设计\">容量仪表盘设计</h3><p>一个完整的容量仪表盘应该覆盖以下信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>面板</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>服务容量健康状态</td>\n<td>各服务 CPU/内存利用率 vs 红线</td>\n<td>一眼看出哪个服务接近极限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动伸缩状态</td>\n<td>HPA 当前/最大副本数，伸缩事件历史</td>\n<td>了解弹性空间是否充足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量趋势</td>\n<td>过去 30 天容量使用趋势</td>\n<td>预判何时需要扩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本效率</td>\n<td>单位流量成本趋势，Rightsizing 潜力</td>\n<td>驱动持续优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大促状态（大促期间）</td>\n<td>各服务实时容量 vs 目标</td>\n<td>大促期间一线监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"容量规划的组织实践\">容量规划的组织实践</h2><p>技术上的容量规划工具和流程，需要配套的组织机制才能持续运转：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>参与者</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>容量例会</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n<td>技术 + 产品 + 运维</td>\n<td>容量状态报告，下月预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RI/SP 采购评审</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>工程 + 财务</td>\n<td>RI 采购决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大促容量准备</td>\n<td>按需（活动前 30 天）</td>\n<td>全体相关团队</td>\n<td>大促预案文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年度容量规划</td>\n<td>每年 Q4</td>\n<td>技术负责人 + 财务</td>\n<td>下年度资源预算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>容量规划的 KPI</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>衡量方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>容量规划准确率</td>\n<td>MAPE &lt; 15%</td>\n<td>实际 vs 预测对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大促零容量事故</td>\n<td>0 次</td>\n<td>事故复盘报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源利用率</td>\n<td>平均 CPU &gt; 40%</td>\n<td>每月 Prometheus 报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RI 利用率</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n<td>云厂商账单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每千 QPS 成本趋势</td>\n<td>持续下降</td>\n<td>成本效率指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>系统化的容量规划流程将技术工具（建模、预测、压测、Rightsizing）组织成<strong>战略层（年度预算）→ 战术层（季度优化）→ 运营层（大促预案 + 红线告警）</strong> 三层可重复执行的闭环。年度规划在 Q4 完成，输出资源预算和架构演进优先级；大促预案从 T-30 天启动，T-14 天全链路压测是核心验证手段；红线告警的三级分级（黄 60%/橙 75%/红 85%）确保在容量耗尽前留出足够响应时间。最终衡量容量规划成熟度的核心 KPI 是：预测 MAPE &lt; 15%、大促零容量事故、平均资源利用率 &gt; 40%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"rightsizing-optimization\">资源适配优化</a>——Rightsizing 是容量规划流程中的重要优化环节</li>\n<li>回顾第一章：<a href=\"../fundamentals/capacity-modeling\">容量建模方法</a>——年度容量规划依赖排队论和 USL 模型量化增长空间</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容量规划流程：年度规划、大促预案与红线告警","id":"容量规划流程-年度规划-大促预案与红线告警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"容量规划的三个时间维度","id":"容量规划的三个时间维度"},{"level":2,"text":"年度容量规划","id":"年度容量规划"},{"level":3,"text":"年度规划流程","id":"年度规划流程"},{"level":2,"text":"大促容量预案","id":"大促容量预案"},{"level":3,"text":"大促预案模板","id":"大促预案模板"},{"level":3,"text":"大促伸缩时间轴","id":"大促伸缩时间轴"},{"level":2,"text":"红线告警体系","id":"红线告警体系"},{"level":3,"text":"红线分级体系","id":"红线分级体系"},{"level":3,"text":"典型红线指标配置","id":"典型红线指标配置"},{"level":3,"text":"容量仪表盘设计","id":"容量仪表盘设计"},{"level":2,"text":"容量规划的组织实践","id":"容量规划的组织实践"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"资源适配优化：Rightsizing 与使用率剖析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/operations/rightsizing-optimization"},"next":null}